---
  config:
    layout: elk
    look: neo
    theme: neutral
---

sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    title: GUI-14 - Display voting equipment history for a state
    actor User
    box Frontend
        participant LandingPage as landingPage#58;DOMNode
        participant Table1 as stateTable#58;DOMNode
        participant Chart as chart#58;DOMNode

        participant Axios as #58;Axios
    end

    box Backend
        participant Controller as #58;Controller
        participant Service as #58;Service
        participant DB as #58;Repository
    end

    note right of DB: IStateDAO in codebase

    User->>LandingPage: Click 'Voting Equipment By State'
    note left of LandingPage: Visits /voting-equipment-by-state/{fipsCode}

    activate LandingPage
    activate Controller
    activate Table1
    LandingPage->>Table1: Render
    User->>Table1: Select a state
    Table1->>Chart: Render
    activate Chart

    par Asynchronous Network Requests
        Chart->>Axios: getVotingEquipmentUsages(fipsCode, 2024)
        Chart->>Axios: getVotingEquipmentUsages(fipsCode, 2022)
        Chart->>Axios: getVotingEquipmentUsages(fipsCode, 2016)
    note left of Axios: We use Orval to generate typesafe request wrappers
    activate Axios

    Axios->>Controller: GET /votingequipment/usages/?regionId={fipsCode}&year=2024
    Axios->>Controller: getVotingEquipmentUsages(fipsCode, year=2024)

    Axios->>Controller: GET /votingequipment/usages/?regionId={fipsCode}&year=2022
    Axios->>Controller: getVotingEquipmentUsages(fipsCode, year=2022)

    Axios->>Controller: GET /votingequipment/usages/?regionId={fipsCode}&year=2016
    Axios->>Controller: getVotingEquipmentUsages(fipsCode, year=2016)
    end

    note left of Controller: For simplicity, we are omitting the Servlet + Jackson Serialization<br/>step, the full-flow of events is shown in the diagram for GUI-2: Display State.
    activate Service
    activate DB
    Controller->>Service: getVotingEquipmentUsages(fipsCode, year=2024)
    Controller->>Service: getVotingEquipmentUsages(fipsCode, year=2020)
    Controller->>Service: getVotingEquipmentUsages(fipsCode, year=2016)

    Service->>DB: getVotingEquipmentUsages(fipsCode, year=2024)
    Service->>DB: getVotingEquipmentUsages(fipsCode, year=2020)
    Service->>DB: getVotingEquipmentUsages(fipsCode, year=2016)
    note left of DB: Calls into our custom ORM solution, performing row mapping<br/>(simplified, full-flow in GUI-2: Display State).
    DB-->>Service: VotingEquipmentUsageSummaryModel
    DB-->>Service: VotingEquipmentUsageSummaryModel
    DB-->>Service: VotingEquipmentUsageSummaryModel
    Service-->>Controller: VotingEquipmentUsageSummaryModel
    Service-->>Controller: VotingEquipmentUsageSummaryModel
    Service-->>Controller: VotingEquipmentUsageSummaryModel
    deactivate Service
    deactivate DB
    note left of Controller: Would be serialized into a JSON string

    par Await until all are completed.
    Controller-->>Axios: HTTP 200 OK: JSONString
    Controller-->>Axios: HTTP 200 OK: JSONString
    Controller-->>Axios: HTTP 200 OK: JSONString
    end
    deactivate Axios

    Axios-->>Chart: List<VotingEquipmentUsageSummaryModel>
    note right of Chart: The returned queries will be aggregated into a list to be passed into<br/>a "multi-bar" graph component.
    note right of Chart: Rendered with the aid of d3
    deactivate Chart
    deactivate Table1
    deactivate Controller
    deactivate LandingPage